      "Syllabus": "Barriers to communication: Basic concepts - Communication Models; Components of communication: Rhetoric and Argumentatio Models and Strategies; Strategies for reading: Reading Methods, Skimming, Scanning, Intensive, and Extensive; Towards careful enunciation: Basics of phonetics; Techniques, common pitfalls; Making presentations: Public Speaking vs Presentations - Presentation styles; Structure and content, Persuasive Speech - Non- verbal communication; Handling group discussions: Types of group discussions, Basic structure; Time Management - Strategies; Writing for technical purposes: Fundamentals of Technical Writing - Types of Documents; Structure and Format - Common Pitfalls; Communication for workplaces: Etiquettes of Professional Communication Situations at Workplace; Communication Ethics."
